<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN MAKE 234-4 VS NEW ZEALAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN MAKE 234-4 VS NEW ZEALAND.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan made 234 for four in 50 overs in the third and final one-day international against New Zealand in Karachi on Sunday.</p>
</text>
